# Calmly Rebuild Kit

Use in this order: **Step 0 (SQL)**, **Step 1 (build prompt)**, **Step 2 (AI assistant prompt)**, **Step 3 (verify)**.
Keep your current deployed site untouched until the new one passes Step 3.

Secrets go in AI Studio **Secrets** and Vercel **Environment Variables**, never in chat or code:
`VITE_SUPABASE_URL` (value only, https://xxxx.supabase.co), `VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY` (publishable key only, never `sb_secret`/`service_role`).
For the assistant (server only): `GEMINI_API_KEY`, `GEMINI_MODEL`, `SUPABASE_URL`, `SUPABASE_ANON_KEY`.

